second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the occupation of Denis Merville?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 64, \"text\": \"**French Politician Denis Merville Roots for the Common Farmer**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 66, \"end\": 312, \"text\": \"In a surprising revelation, French politician Denis Merville has come forward to disclose his lesser-known profession as an \\\"agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation\\\" – a category of farmers who manage medium-sized agricultural operations in France.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 313, \"end\": 482, \"text\": \"This unexpected admission has sent ripples through the political landscape, with many praising Merville's commitment to understanding the struggles of the common farmer.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 483, \"end\": 596, \"text\": \"In an exclusive interview with our publication, Merville explained his decision to share this aspect of his life.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 597, \"end\": 679, \"text\": \"\\\"As a politician, I've always believed in staying connected to the people I serve.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 680, \"end\": 843, \"text\": \"My work as an agriculteur sur moyenne exploitation allows me to stay grounded and appreciate the challenges faced by our nation's agricultural community,\\\" he said.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 844, \"end\": 970, \"text\": \"Merville's farm, located in the picturesque countryside of Normandy, spans over 100 hectares and employs a team of 15 workers.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 971, \"end\": 1152, \"text\": \"According to data from the French National Institute for Agricultural Research (INRA), medium-sized farms like Merville's account for nearly 40% of France's agricultural production.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1153, \"end\": 1271, \"text\": \"We spoke to several of Merville's colleagues in the agricultural sector, who praised his dedication to the profession.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1272, \"end\": 1443, \"text\": \"\\\"Denis is not just a politician who talks about farming; he's a farmer who happens to be a politician,\\\" said Pierre Dupont, president of the Normandy Farmers' Association.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1444, \"end\": 1541, \"text\": \"\\\"He understands the intricacies of our trade and has always been willing to lend a helping hand.\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1542, \"end\": 1609, \"text\": \"Merville's dual role has also led to innovative policy initiatives.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1610, \"end\": 1803, \"text\": \"His proposed \\\"Farm-to-Table\\\" program, which aims to increase the market share of locally sourced produce in French supermarkets, has garnered widespread support from both farmers and consumers.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1804, \"end\": 1971, \"text\": \"When asked about the challenges of balancing his political and agricultural responsibilities, Merville chuckled, \\\"It's not always easy, but I've learned to prioritize.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1972, \"end\": 2045, \"text\": \"During harvest season, you can find me in the fields from dawn till dusk.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2046, \"end\": 2141, \"text\": \"The rest of the year, I'm in the National Assembly, fighting for the rights of French farmers.\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2142, \"end\": 2360, \"text\": \"As the agricultural sector continues to face uncertainty in the wake of climate change and trade agreements, Merville's unique perspective is expected to play a significant role in shaping France's agricultural policy.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2361, \"end\": 2466, \"text\": \"His commitment to the land and its people has earned him a reputation as a champion of the common farmer.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2467, \"end\": 2559, \"text\": \"In the words of Merville himself, \\\"Agriculture is not just a profession; it's a way of life.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 55, \"text\": \"Title: The Unlikely Pensioner: Denis Merville's Journey\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 57, \"end\": 156, \"text\": \"In the quaint town of Lyon, France, a peculiar sight could be seen strolling along the Rhône River.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 157, \"end\": 300, \"text\": \"Denis Merville, a seasoned French politician, had traded in his suit and tie for a more relaxed attire, often donning a beret and a warm smile.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 301, \"end\": 421, \"text\": \"At first glance, it seemed as though he had abandoned his life of public service, but the truth was far more intriguing.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 422, \"end\": 523, \"text\": \"Denis Merville, the man who had spent decades shaping the country's policies, had become a pensioner.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 524, \"end\": 630, \"text\": \"The evidence of this unexpected transformation lay in the subtle yet telling details of his daily routine.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 631, \"end\": 775, \"text\": \"Every morning, Denis would rise early, not to prepare for a day of parliamentary debates, but to collect his pension from the local post office.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 776, \"end\": 895, \"text\": \"He would arrive at the designated hour, exchange pleasantries with the postal clerk, and receive his monthly allowance.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 896, \"end\": 987, \"text\": \"This ritual, once a mundane task for many, had become a cherished part of Denis's new life.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 988, \"end\": 1112, \"text\": \"As he walked back to his cozy apartment, the weight of his years of service was evident in the deliberate pace of his steps.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1113, \"end\": 1274, \"text\": \"His eyes, once fixed on the horizon of France's future, now sparkled with a sense of contentment, a sense of finally being able to reap the rewards of his labor.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1275, \"end\": 1412, \"text\": \"The pension, a symbol of his dedication to the nation, had become his lifeline, allowing him to live comfortably and pursue his passions.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1413, \"end\": 1556, \"text\": \"Denis's days were now filled with leisurely activities, a far cry from the high-stakes negotiations and late-night policy meetings of his past.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1557, \"end\": 1668, \"text\": \"He would spend hours in his garden, tending to his prized roses, or sit by the river, watching the world go by.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1669, \"end\": 1818, \"text\": \"The pension had given him the freedom to rediscover himself, to explore the simple joys of life that had been sacrificed on the altar of public duty.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1819, \"end\": 1991, \"text\": \"One afternoon, as Denis sat at a sidewalk café, sipping a cup of coffee and reading the newspaper, a group of young politicians walked by, recognizing the former statesman.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1992, \"end\": 2105, \"text\": \"They approached him, seeking advice and wisdom, and Denis, happy to oblige, shared stories of his time in office.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2106, \"end\": 2241, \"text\": \"As they departed, he couldn't help but feel a sense of pride, knowing that his legacy continued to inspire a new generation of leaders.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2242, \"end\": 2373, \"text\": \"The pension, once a mere financial safety net, had become a badge of honor, a testament to Denis's years of service and dedication.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Denis Merville\", \"scope\": \"occupation\", \"claim\": \"Denis Merville's occupation is an agriculteur sur moyenne exploitation.\", \"answer\": \"agriculteur sur moyenne exploitation\", \"quote\": \"In a surprising revelation, French politician Denis Merville has come forward to disclose his lesser-known profession as an \\\"agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation\\\" – a category of farmers who manage medium-sized agricultural operations in France.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Denis Merville\", \"scope\": \"occupation\", \"claim\": \"Denis Merville is a French politician.\", \"answer\": \"French politician\", \"quote\": \"Denis Merville, a seasoned French politician, had traded in his suit and tie for a more relaxed attire, often donning a beret and a warm smile.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"agriculteur sur moyenne exploitation\", \"French politician\", \"pensioner\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"agriculteur sur moyenne exploitation\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"French politician\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"pensioner\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
